{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 26, :comments ["<b>With the pious one He shows His kindness.</b> גבר — it is in masculine form and is not in construct state." "<b>תתמם</b> — the third tav is elided, like תתחזק. And the meaning is: He shows your deed that is תמים, or: you are תמים in knowledge."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:27:36.967993035Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}